@host = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@example.com", "password": "senha-forte-123" }

### Pegar uma sala
# @name rooms
GET {{host}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 1. Reserva válida (esperado: 201)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{ "roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$.data[0].id}}", "startsAt": "2027-03-10T13:00:00-03:00", "endsAt": "2027-03-10T14:00:00-03:00" }

### 2. Mesmo horário (esperado: 409 BOOKING_CONFLICT)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{ "roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$.data[0].id}}", "startsAt": "2027-03-10T13:00:00-03:00", "endsAt": "2027-03-10T14:00:00-03:00" }

### 3. Sobreposição parcial (esperado: 409)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{ "roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$.data[0].id}}", "startsAt": "2027-03-10T13:30:00-03:00", "endsAt": "2027-03-10T14:30:00-03:00" }

### 4. Logo depois da anterior, sem sobrepor (esperado: 201)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{ "roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$.data[0].id}}", "startsAt": "2027-03-10T14:00:00-03:00", "endsAt": "2027-03-10T15:00:00-03:00" }

### 5. Fim antes do início (esperado: 400)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{ "roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$.data[0].id}}", "startsAt": "2027-03-11T15:00:00-03:00", "endsAt": "2027-03-11T14:00:00-03:00" }

### 6. No passado (esperado: 422 BOOKING_IN_PAST)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{ "roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$.data[0].id}}", "startsAt": "2020-03-10T13:00:00-03:00", "endsAt": "2020-03-10T14:00:00-03:00" }

### 7. Curta demais, 10 min (esperado: 422 INVALID_DURATION)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{ "roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$.data[0].id}}", "startsAt": "2027-03-12T13:00:00-03:00", "endsAt": "2027-03-12T13:10:00-03:00" }

### 8. Longa demais, 10 h (esperado: 422 INVALID_DURATION)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{ "roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$.data[0].id}}", "startsAt": "2027-03-12T08:00:00-03:00", "endsAt": "2027-03-12T18:00:00-03:00" }

### 9. Data sem fuso horário (esperado: 400)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{ "roomId": "{{rooms.response.body.$.data[0].id}}", "startsAt": "2027-03-12T13:00:00", "endsAt": "2027-03-12T14:00:00" }

### 10. Sala desativada (Sala Delta) (esperado: 404)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{ "roomId": "2ac96a45-5c44-476f-858b-da8e1aa8a7d8", "startsAt": "2027-03-12T13:00:00-03:00", "endsAt": "2027-03-12T14:00:00-03:00" }

### 11. Sem token (esperado: 401)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000", "startsAt": "2027-03-12T13:00:00-03:00", "endsAt": "2027-03-12T14:00:00-03:00" }